      "writtenOn": "2025-04-10T14:20:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, the `fontations_compare_ft_*` changes are just due to the bounds being tighter (previously this calculated the bounds for subpixel smoothing but then didn\u0027t do the smoothing). The changes to `typefacerendering` are the only real changes this makes, which is to consistently not do subpixel smoothing when doing fake bold and path effects as well.",
      "parentUuid": "cd3b4cb4_ca6a1c80",
      "revId": "265db5d689bae9cf22c9c704b74e13b6060a19b5",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
